# Ajani's Anguish: "it deals X damage to any target." With X = 1, one below the Ornithopter's toughness of 2, the damage is marked and
# the creature lives (the neighbouring scenario at X = 2 is exactly lethal). Ruby pays {R} and Jet and Pearl pay X.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ajani's Anguish
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x25

